{"id":4245,"date":"2020-01-13T12:41:56","date_gmt":"2020-01-13T18:41:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/pokernight.com\/15-2-2\/"},"modified":"2020-01-13T12:43:10","modified_gmt":"2020-01-13T18:43:10","slug":"15-2-2","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/pokernight.com\/15-2-2\/","title":{"rendered":"NEW EPISODE 10PM + NEW EPISODE ON YOUTUBE + SEASON 1"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>[et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.5&#8243; use_background_color_gradient=&#8221;on&#8221; background_color_gradient_start=&#8221;#f2f2f2&#8243; background_color_gradient_end=&#8221;#f2f2f2&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;0px|||||&#8221;][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;3.25&#8243;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;3.25&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;|||&#8221; custom_padding__hover=&#8221;|||&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.1&#8243; background_size=&#8221;initial&#8221; background_position=&#8221;top_left&#8221; background_repeat=&#8221;repeat&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;3px|||||&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243;]<\/p>\n<p>Good Afternoon Pokerphiles,<\/p>\n<p>We\u2019ve made it through another week of Earth. Congratulations. Celebrate the 104,990th Monday since we started recording time this way by tuning into CBS Sports Network tonight at 10pmET for Part 2 of NHL Enforcer\u2019s Night on Celebrity Home Game. In the meantime, check out Part 2 of PRO WRESTLERS NIGHT which we\u2019ve uploaded in full on Youtube. But wait, there\u2019s more: Poker Night has decided to release our very first Season for your on-demand viewing in it\u2019s most poker-y form: Just the Hands. Episodes 1 and 2 of Season 1 are available now!<\/p>\n<p>10pmET: ENFORCERS NIGHT [PART 2]<\/p>\n<div data-empty=\"true\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/gallery.eomail1.com\/74d178ac-fc7f-11e7-a98f-06b2d989fe84%2F1578331756448-CHG+Promotions.jpg\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" \/><\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Now: PRO WRESTLERS NIGHT [PART 2]<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/gallery.eomail1.com\/74d178ac-fc7f-11e7-a98f-06b2d989fe84%2F1578939659882-2020-01-13+12_20_30-FD+Newsletter+for+1_13_2019+PNIA+-+Google+Docs.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"599\" \/><\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Now: Poker Night in America Season 1, Episodes 1&amp;2: Just the Hands<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=YrHRj_HPwQs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferer noreferrer\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/gallery.eomail1.com\/74d178ac-fc7f-11e7-a98f-06b2d989fe84%2F1578939778553-2020-01-13+12_22_01-FD+Newsletter+for+1_13_2019+PNIA+-+Google+Docs.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"338.656\" \/><\/a><\/div>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=YrHRj_HPwQs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferer noreferrer\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/gallery.eomail1.com\/74d178ac-fc7f-11e7-a98f-06b2d989fe84%2F1576517180654-1576517180399.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"56.5313\" \/><\/a>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Have a great week, and remember to fight for your right to poker,<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Poker Night in America<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section]<\/p>\n<span class=\"et_bloom_bottom_trigger\"><\/span>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Good Afternoon Pokerphiles, We\u2019ve made it through another week of Earth. Congratulations. Celebrate the 104,990th Monday since we started recording time this way by tuning into CBS Sports Network tonight at 10pmET for Part 2 of NHL Enforcer\u2019s Night on Celebrity Home Game. In the meantime, check out Part 2 of PRO WRESTLERS NIGHT which [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":4247,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"gallery","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"on","_et_pb_old_content":"<p dir=\"ltr\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4115\" src=\"https:\/\/pokernight.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/2019-01-18-15_00_17-Untitled-document-Google-Docs-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1025\" height=\"683\" \/><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">On the sad news of Gavin Smith passing, the Poker Night in America crew wanted to express a few thoughts about one of our favorite players to ever join our table. <\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It only took a few moments after meeting Gavin to learn a few things about him. First, you would learn immediately that he was genuine. He would tell you exactly what was on his mind, without hesitation or qualification. It\u2019s often said that every word spoken before the word \u201cbut\u201d is BS, and Gavin never used \u201cbut\u201d. He just said everything that came after, and left you to deal with it. <\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Which you usually could, because the next thing that became apparent in Gavin\u2019s presence was that he was hilarious. Swarthy, Canadian-accented humor rolled out of him effortlessly, and cut any tension that his candor might create. As creators of poker entertainment content, we can\u2019t overstate how great it was to have someone like Gavin at our table keeping it active and funny.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Between the lines of his jokes was a rapier wit that never seemed to dull, even in the midst of his well-known excesses. His intelligence was considerable, and seemed to be only matched by his restlessness in life. <\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The final thing that needs to be said is that Gavin Smith knew all the names of the members of our production crew. He may have been the only poker player that has been on our show that can claim that. He partied with us, and cracked us up, and he\u2019d ask about our lives from event to event. It seems small, but to us, it was a big deal. For that, for his candor, and his humor, he\u2019ll always have our love and respect. <\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/imgur.com\/a\/MCSQbqY\">Here are some of the photos<\/a> we have of Gavin from his appearances on our show. Please feel free to use these in any way you see fit in your remembrances, with no attribution required.<\/span><\/p><p>If you would like to help the Smith family, a GoFundMe account <a href=\"https:\/\/www.gofundme.com\/rip-ol039-gavin-smith\">has been created here.<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>","_et_gb_content_width":"","_exactmetrics_skip_tracking":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_active":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_note":"","_exactmetrics_sitenote_category":0,"footnotes":""},"categories":[13,105],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4245","post","type-post","status-publish","format-gallery","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog","category-featured-on-homepage","post_format-post-format-gallery"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.3 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>NEW EPISODE 10PM + NEW EPISODE ON YOUTUBE + SEASON 1 - Poker Night in America<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/pokernight.com\/15-2-2\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"NEW EPISODE 10PM + NEW EPISODE ON YOUTUBE + SEASON 1 - Poker Night in America\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Good Afternoon Pokerphiles, We\u2019ve made it through another week of Earth. Congratulations. Celebrate the 104,990th Monday since we started recording time this way by tuning into CBS Sports Network tonight at 10pmET for Part 2 of NHL Enforcer\u2019s Night on Celebrity Home Game. In the meantime, check out Part 2 of PRO WRESTLERS NIGHT which [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property